  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Morning Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    18 August 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good morning Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,183.75/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,170.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PARKER</td>\n                <td>₦1,195.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MAINLAND</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SOBAZ</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ARDOVA</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NORTHWEST</td>\n                <td>₦1,185.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BULK STRATEGIC</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>LIQUID BULK</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,640.62/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,575.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>T.TIME</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBACHEM</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBETO</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SAHARA</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Oil Prices Climb Nearly 3% After Iran Rules Out Strait of Hormuz MOU\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Oil prices rose sharply on Monday as Iran rejected an extension of its understanding with the United States. Brent crude was trading at $90.66 per barrel, up $2.14, or 2.42% , while West Texas Intermediate (WTI) stood at $84.27 per barrel. The rally came after Iran ruled out extending a memorandum of understanding reached with Washington in June.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/oil-prices-climb-nearly-3-after-iran-rules-out-strait-of-hormuz-mou\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump to Iran: Surrender or Face Military Strikes\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump has demanded that Iran surrender to end the war with the United States. Speaking to a Fox News reporter by phone on Monday, Trump said Iran should “put up the white flag of surrender” Comments came as an interim agreement between the United. States and Iran appeared to have collapsed.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-to-iran-surrender-or-face-military-strikes\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    ECOWAS Fuel Price Unification Talks Reach Advanced Stage – NMDPRA\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                     negotiations to establish a unified fuel quality standard across the Economic Community of West African States have reached an advanced stage. NMDPRA Chief Executive, Rabiu Umar, who is also Chairman of the West Africa Regulators’ Forum, disclosed this on Wednesday. He said regional integration would allow member states to leverage their respective strengths.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/ecowas-fuel-price-unification-talks-reach-advanced-stage-nmdpra\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Liberia Joins West Africa's Energy Leaders at OTL Africa 2026\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Liberia Petroleum Products Retailers Union (LIPPRU) has confirmed its participation in the 20th anniversary edition of OTL Africa Downstream Energy Week. The event is scheduled for 25–30 October 2026 at the Oriental Hotel, Lagos, under the theme \"Secure Energy, Share Prosperity\" LIPPRu President Prince Tambah Nyumah said the invitation gives Liberia the opportunity to showcase developments in its petroleum sector.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/liberia-joins-west-africas-energy-leaders-at-otl-africa-2026\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    FG Resets Deepwater Profit Split to 70:30 to Lure Fresh Investment\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Federal Government has introduced a new fiscal incentive that could give fresh deepwater oil projects a significantly more attractive starting position. Under the new Profit Oil Reset mechanism, an approved greenfield development will not inherit the more burdensome profit-oil sharing level reached by existing production within the same contract area.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/fg-resets-deepwater-profit-split-to-7030-to-lure-fresh-investment\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
